# Playwright MCP usage

Use MCP browser tools to discover stable locators before writing POM code.

## Preferred flow

1. `browser_navigate` to `getEnvConfig().baseUrl` (or local dummy app)
2. `browser_snapshot` — pick roles/labels/`data-test` from the a11y tree
3. Interact with `browser_click` / `browser_type` / `browser_fill_form` to validate the path
4. Map confirmed locators into `pages/*.page.ts`
5. Write the spec against page methods only

## Locator priority

1. `getByRole` / `getByLabel` / `getByTestId` / `[data-test=...]`
2. Stable text with `getByText` (avoid long copy)
3. CSS id/class last; avoid positional nth-child when possible

## Practice targets

- UI remote: Sauce Demo (`ENV=qa`)
- UI local: `ENV=local` → http://127.0.0.1:4173
- API: ReqRes or local `/api`
